# Build context of the container image (docs/adr/0015): everything is left out,
# then only what the Dockerfile copies is let back in. No .git, no tests, no
# local data, no .env file can reach the image.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!manage.py
!design/
!src/

# Caches and editor files, even inside the directories let in above.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swp
